<title>POLAND: Olawa falls after lowering 96 net profit.</title>
<headline>Olawa falls after lowering 96 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish non-ferrous metals producer Huta Olawa SA fell 5.3 percent to 12.4 zlotys after Tuesday's announcement that it was cutting its 1996 net profit figure due to tax office decisions on additional income tax.</p>
<p>&quot;The fall today was clearly linked to the profit revision,&quot; one trader said about the fall in 1.5-million-zloty trade.</p>
<p>Olawa said it was reducing its 1996 net to 1.14 million zlotys from the 3.02 million announced earlier.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
